        "target_customer": "度假租赁房主",
        "funding_summary": "",
        "core_difference": "Fairly为每处房产配置本地看护人员并由平台提供运营软件；传统管理公司主要依赖集中化团队和呼叫中心。收费上Fairly称房主支付单一20%费用，而其他管理者通常收取25%至40%。",
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-af94d5a75d980eef",
            "quote": "Instead of relying primarily on centralised teams and call centres, it puts a local caretaker in charge of each property while its software manages pricing, booking distribution, guest communication, scheduling and owner reporting.",
